{"id":"steam-731830","steam":731830,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Warpflux","summary":"Warpflux is a top-down action based resource management game. As the commander of Earth's colony ship and a fleet of autonomous drones, collect supplies and defend against hostile forces during a thousand year voyage to save humanity.","about":"In Warpflux you assume the role of the only living officer aboard an autonomous colony ship. The destination? A new birthplace for humanity. Take command and decide the best course of action during the thousand-year long voyage full of perils. \r\n\r\nFeatures\r\n\n\r\n•  Defend against enemies during an intense, time-limited resource gathering phase\r\n•  Carefully plan and manage a limited number of actions before entering cryo sleep\r\n•  Collect research and use it to unlock new upgrades \r\n•  Encounter crisis events and make tough decisions\r\n•  Explore procedurally generated solar systems","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/731830/library_600x900.jpg?t=1791552633","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/731830/header.jpg?t=1791552633","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/731830/library_hero.jpg?t=1791552633","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/731830/header.jpg?t=1791552633","background":null,"screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/731830/ss_e7d016ed53cc18bae74406931d0e3bce91a70803.600x338.jpg?t=1791552633","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/731830/ss_e7d016ed53cc18bae74406931d0e3bce91a70803.jpg?t=1791552633"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/731830/ss_afeef63b7ef4ebb153a7bcd34730dbfbc8403f27.600x338.jpg?t=1791552633","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/731830/ss_afeef63b7ef4ebb153a7bcd34730db